+
+## Findings summary
+
+### Correct (already good — reuse as-is)
+- `load_config(config_path)` (`main.py:100`) + `DEFAULT_CONFIG_PATH` (`main.py:51`): standalone, dict-returning, no daemon coupling. Reuse verbatim for the `--config` flag.
